**************************************************************************** Nitropack in the laravel ***********************************************************************************

1. Register your website in the NitroPack application.
2. Click on Cache Settings > General Options, and you will see the API Keys.
3. Place the nitropack-sdk folder in the root directory. (https://nitropack.io/download/plugin/nitropack-php-sdk-limited-support)
4. Open the index.php file located in the public folder, and add the following line of code at the beginning.

define("NITROPACK_HOME_URL", "https://www.metricwaveinsights.com/");
